# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CFG Server Manager module — environment variables
#
# The Server Manager is a plain FoundryVTT module — no env vars are required to install,
# load, or build it. The variables below are only used by the integration
# test stack (Foundry container + Playwright).
#
# Integration-test env lives in tests/.env.test.example. Copy it to
# tests/.env.test before running `npm run test:foundry:up`:
#
#   cp tests/.env.test.example tests/.env.test
#   # fill in FOUNDRY_LICENSE_KEY / FOUNDRY_USERNAME / FOUNDRY_PASSWORD
#
# That file documents:
#   FOUNDRY_LICENSE_KEY      — required for the felddy/foundryvtt container
#   FOUNDRY_USERNAME         — Foundry account username
#   FOUNDRY_PASSWORD         — Foundry account password
#   FOUNDRY_ADMIN_KEY        — admin password for the test world (default: cfgtestadmin)
#   CORE_API_URL             — Core platform under test (default: http://localhost:10001)
#   CORE_TEST_CAMPAIGN_ID    — pre-existing campaign id, or blank to auto-create
#   CORE_TEST_API_KEY        — cfk_-prefixed API key for self-hosted suite
#   CORE_ADMIN_API_KEY       — admin key, only needed when CORE_TEST_CAMPAIGN_ID is blank
#
# This file is kept as a pointer so the contract is discoverable from the
# repo root.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
